WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.097
This is a recording of the running app with fictional training records.

5
00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:06.237
Cloud responses and G P S are simulated.

9
00:00:06.237 --> 00:00:08.857
Sign in using your company username and password.

13
00:00:08.857 --> 00:00:10.248
Never share your password.

17
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:15.654
Before your first shift, open the invitation sent by your subcontractor administrator.

21
00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:18.439
Enter your own name, username and a strong password.

25
00:00:18.439 --> 00:00:20.688
Company and role come from the invitation.

29
00:00:20.688 --> 00:00:22.830
Wait for company approval, then sign in.

33
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.693
My work shows the jobs assigned to you.

37
00:00:25.693 --> 00:00:29.342
Check the site photograph, location, work instructions and equipment.

41
00:00:29.342 --> 00:00:31.299
Open View assignment before starting.

45
00:00:31.299 --> 00:00:34.895
If the job or location is wrong, contact your company administrator.

49
00:00:35.695 --> 00:00:37.843
Open the assignment and choose Check in.

53
00:00:37.843 --> 00:00:40.046
Select the correct assigned crew members.

57
00:00:40.046 --> 00:00:43.806
Tap Capture current location and allow precise location on your phone.

61
00:00:43.806 --> 00:00:45.579
Save only after capture succeeds.

65
00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:47.835
This recording uses simulated coordinates.

69
00:00:48.635 --> 00:00:51.098
During the job, choose Update tasks and loads.

73
00:00:51.098 --> 00:00:53.508
Tick only work actually completed, then save.

77
00:00:53.508 --> 00:00:56.025
For a hauling job, enter completed whole loads.

81
00:00:56.025 --> 00:01:00.470
Keep the assignment instructions in view and report problems to your administrator.

85
00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:02.508
Choose Upload evidence.

89
00:01:02.508 --> 00:01:05.955
Select Work photo and choose a clear picture of the actual work.

93
00:01:05.955 --> 00:01:08.486
Hauling work also needs the requested timecard.

97
00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:11.663
Supported files are images or P D F, up to eight megabytes.

101
00:01:11.663 --> 00:01:14.248
Do not substitute the site reference photograph.

105
00:01:14.248 --> 00:01:16.941
This demonstration file is labelled training only.

109
00:01:17.741 --> 00:01:21.801
When the job is finished, choose Check out and capture your location again.

113
00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:24.074
Enter any unpaid break minutes, then save.

117
00:01:24.074 --> 00:01:27.213
A check in position cannot replace a new checkout capture.

121
00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:29.757
If location fails, enable permission and retry.

125
00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:33.637
After all crew members check out, select Submit my hours.

129
00:01:33.637 --> 00:01:35.852
Usually keep Use the exact recorded time.

133
00:01:35.852 --> 00:01:40.282
If you need a different claim, untick it, enter the claimed hours and explain why.

137
00:01:40.282 --> 00:01:42.875
Submit for your company administrator to review.

141
00:01:43.675 --> 00:01:47.424
Open My hours to see recorded, claimed and accepted time separately.

145
00:01:47.424 --> 00:01:50.016
Your company checks first, then N P I verifies.

149
00:01:50.016 --> 00:01:52.221
A submitted claim is not final approval.

153
00:01:52.221 --> 00:01:56.907
Return to the work record if a correction is requested and follow the written reason.

157
00:01:57.707 --> 00:02:00.545
Locations shows site names, photographs and addresses.

161
00:02:00.545 --> 00:02:04.328
Map links in attendance show the captured check in or checkout position.

165
00:02:04.328 --> 00:02:08.426
Contact your company administrator for assignments, approval or password help.

169
00:02:08.426 --> 00:02:09.792
Sign out on shared phones.
